<view class="container">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="logo">💜</view>
    <view class="app-name">AI 提示词小抄</view>
    <view class="app-subtitle muted">PromptVault · v{{version}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="stats">
    <view class="stat-item">
      <view class="stat-num">{{promptCount}}</view>
      <view class="stat-label muted">条内置 Prompt</view>
    </view>
    <view class="stat-item">
      <view class="stat-num">{{articleCount}}</view>
      <view class="stat-label muted">篇文章</view>
    </view>
    <view class="stat-item">
      <view class="stat-num">{{surfaces}}</view>
      <view class="stat-label muted">个产品端</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">这是什么</view>
    <view class="section-body">给经常使用 AI 工具的人准备的本地提示词库：按场景搜索、填写变量、预览后复制。收藏、自定义 Prompt、搜索记录和最近记录只保存在当前设备。</view>
    <view class="section-body">小程序不建立 PromptVault 账号，也没有开发者云同步服务。运营者启用微信流量主后，广告组件会按照微信平台规则联网。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">5 个端同源</view>
    <view class="section-body">同一套 Prompt 产品还提供以下使用方式：</view>
    <view class="surface-list">
      <view class="surface-item"><text class="surface-icon">📱</text><text class="surface-text">iOS App</text></view>
      <view class="surface-item"><text class="surface-icon">🌐</text><text class="surface-text">网页端</text></view>
      <view class="surface-item"><text class="surface-icon">🎨</text><text class="surface-text">浏览器扩展</text></view>
      <view class="surface-item"><text class="surface-icon">💻</text><text class="surface-text">VS Code 扩展</text></view>
      <view class="surface-item"><text class="surface-icon">💬</text><text class="surface-text">微信小程序</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section action-section">
    <view class="section-title">联系与透明度</view>
    <view class="action-row" bindtap="onCopyEmail">
      <text class="action-icon">📬</text>
      <view class="action-text">
        <view class="action-title">联系邮箱</view>
        <view class="action-sub muted">jiejuefuyou@gmail.com（点按复制）</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="action-row" bindtap="onGoPrivacy">
      <text class="action-icon">🔒</text>
      <view class="action-text">
        <view class="action-title">隐私与广告说明</view>
        <view class="action-sub muted">区分本机数据、微信平台和广告处理</view>
      </view>
      <text class="action-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">内容说明</view>
    <view class="section-body">内置 Prompt 经过整理、翻译和改写，用于提供可直接填写的通用模板。使用前仍应检查事实、敏感信息、版权和目标 AI 工具的输出。</view>
    <view class="section-body">发现来源标注、内容质量或权利问题，可通过邮箱联系修正或移除。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer muted">
    <view>Made with 💜 by jiejuefuyou</view>
    <view>© 2026 · MIT License · <text class="muted-link" bindtap="onCopyGithub">复制源码地址</text></view>
  </view>
</view>
